WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.094 --> 00:00:03.844
WENWU
Throughout my life...

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:08.300
...the Ten Rings
gave our family power.

00:00:11.618 --> 00:00:14.555
If you want them
to be yours one day,

00:00:14.555 --> 00:00:17.976
you have to show me
you're strong enough to carry them.

00:00:18.322 --> 00:00:20.743
♪♪

00:00:22.212 --> 00:00:23.611
YING NAN
You are a product of all

00:00:23.611 --> 00:00:25.050
who came before you.

00:00:26.213 --> 00:00:28.028
The legacy of your family.

00:00:28.759 --> 00:00:32.978
You are your mother.
And whether you like it or not...

00:00:32.978 --> 00:00:34.645
...you are also your father.

00:00:37.894 --> 00:00:39.918
♪♪

00:00:39.943 --> 00:00:41.863
WENWU
I told my men...

00:00:41.863 --> 00:00:44.972
...they wouldn't be able to
to kill you if they tried.

00:00:53.316 --> 00:00:54.916
WENWU
Glad I was right.

00:00:56.034 --> 00:00:58.140
♪♪

00:00:58.165 --> 00:01:01.562
SHANG-CHI
You're just a criminal who murders people.

00:01:02.659 --> 00:01:05.107
WENWU
Be careful how you speak to me, boy.

00:01:05.290 --> 00:01:10.407
♪♪

00:01:12.401 --> 00:01:13.949
SHANG-CHI
I thought I could change my name,

00:01:15.120 --> 00:01:16.368
...start a new life.

00:01:19.479 --> 00:01:23.000
But I could never escape his shadow.

00:01:27.986 --> 00:01:29.089
WENWU
My son...

00:01:30.033 --> 00:01:31.966
You can't run from your past.

00:01:38.671 --> 00:01:40.171
SHANG-CHI
Is this what you wanted?

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:46.765
♪♪

00:01:49.665 --> 00:01:50.798
KATY
You got this.

00:01:50.823 --> 00:01:52.696
ABOMINATION
[Roars]

00:01:54.079 --> 00:01:55.304
SHANG-CHI
Thank you.

